        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "The reference supplies Laema's identity, costume and hammer construction. Laema is the same young adult woman with a curious alert expression, platinum-white high ponytail, fitted blue sleeveless waistcoat, cream rolled-sleeve shirt, red waist sash, brown leather cross-body strap and pouch, brown trousers, fingerless gloves and tall brown boots. Her hammer has a broad double-ended geometric head, dark inset panels, steel plates, bronze faceted fittings and narrow orange-red luminous seams. Render confident painted shapes, fine modeled-volume shading, convincing cloth/leather/metal separation, clear anatomy and expressive facial drawing. Use restrained base colors and concentrated metal highlights, without coarse pixel blocks or plastic-looking skin. Follow the user's requested pose, expression, framing and setting. Use a plain gray background only if no setting is requested. No text or watermark.\n\nUSER REQUEST:\n"
      ]
    },
